  "description": "High-performance C# FIX protocol engine for .NET. Features strongly-typed message generation from FIX XML dictionaries, automatic serialization/deserialization, full session management (logon, heartbeat, sequence numbers, gap fill recovery), SSL/TLS support, file and memory message stores, and broker reset handling. Supports FIX 4.x and 5.x protocols.",
